{%- liquid
  comment
    TT COUPLE KAPSUL -- "Ayriyken biriktirin, bulusunca acin."

    Yalnizca couple koleksiyon sablonunda kullaniliyor. Gorsel dili
    "Video Hero -- Kapsul" bolumunden aliniyor (koyu zemin, hap, iki
    satirlik baslik + yesil vurgu, yildiz satiri, yuvarlak medya alani)
    ama medya alaninin icinde video degil, CSS ile cizilmis bir sahne
    var: iki kapsul bulusuyor ve zaman cizgisinde anilar birikiyor.

    SAHNENIN STATIK HALI SUNUCUDAN GELIYOR
    Isaretlemenin kendisi "animasyon bitmis" hali cizer: kapsuller yan
    yana ve acik, butun noktalar gorunur, sayac son degerde. JS devreye
    girince koke data-ck-on basiliyor ve CSS animasyonlu hale geciyor.
    Boylece JS yokken de, azaltilmis harekette de ekranda dogru bir
    gorsel duruyor -- ek bir "reduced motion" isaretlemesi gerekmiyor.

    Butun siniflar .tt-ck-*, butun keyframe adlari bolum id'si ile
    bitiyor: ayni sayfada iki ornek birbirine karismaz, dongu seridinin
    .tt-cd-* dunyasina da dokunmaz.
  endcomment

  assign sid = section.id
  assign s = section.settings
  assign bloklar = section.blocks

  comment
    ZAMAN CIZGISI ARALIGI
    number ayarlari bos birakilabilir (nil) -- plus: 0 ile sayiya
    cevrilip makul degerlere cekiliyor, aksi halde bolme patlar.
  endcomment
  assign yb = s.yil_bas | plus: 0
  if yb < 1900
    assign yb = 2025
  endif
  assign ys = s.yil_son | plus: 0
  if ys < yb
    assign ys = yb
  endif
  assign yil_sayisi = ys | minus: yb | plus: 1
  assign toplam_ay = yil_sayisi | times: 12
  comment
    Baslangic yilinin Ocak'i sol uc, bitis yilinin Aralik'i sag uc:
    aradaki mesafe (toplam ay - 1).
  endcomment
  assign bolen = toplam_ay | minus: 1
  if bolen < 1
    assign bolen = 1
  endif

  comment
    KAPSUL YUVALARININ ORANI
    Gorselin kendi oraniyla cizilince contain bos kenar birakmiyor;
    kose yuvarlatmasi ve kilit rozeti gorselin uzerine oturuyor.
  endcomment
  assign oran1 = '86 / 106'
  if s.gorsel_1 != blank
    assign oran1 = s.gorsel_1.aspect_ratio
  endif
  assign oran2 = '86 / 106'
  if s.gorsel_2 != blank
    assign oran2 = s.gorsel_2.aspect_ratio
  endif

  comment
    ON GECIS: sayacin statik (son) degeri icin son blogun sayisi.
    Isaretlemede sayac sahnenin en ustunde, noktalar en altinda --
    bu yuzden son deger noktalar cizilmeden once gerekiyor.
  endcomment
  assign son_sayi = 0
  for block in bloklar
    assign n = block.settings.foto | plus: 0
    if n > 0
      assign son_sayi = n
    endif
  endfor
-%}

{%- comment -%}
  Binlik ayracli bicim (tr-TR). Liquid'de hazir filtre yok; sayinin
  karakterleri sagdan sola gezilip her ucte bir nokta konuyor.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- capture son_bicim -%}
  {%- assign ham = son_sayi | append: '' -%}
  {%- assign uz = ham.size -%}
  {%- assign bic = '' -%}
  {%- for i in (1..uz) -%}
    {%- assign yer = uz | minus: i -%}
    {%- assign ch = ham | slice: yer, 1 -%}
    {%- assign bic = ch | append: bic -%}
    {%- assign m = i | modulo: 3 -%}
    {%- if m == 0 and yer > 0 -%}
      {%- assign bic = '.' | append: bic -%}
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
  {{- bic -}}
{%- endcapture -%}
{%- assign son_bicim = son_bicim | strip -%}

<style>
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-root {
    --ck-vurgu: {{ s.vurgu_renk }};
    --ck-sahne1: {{ s.sahne_renk_1 }};
    --ck-sahne2: {{ s.sahne_renk_2 }};
    --ck-kapsul-g: 86px;
    --ck-kapsul-y: 106px;
    --ck-ayrik: 34px;
    --ck-gorsel-kose: {{ s.gorsel_kose }}px;
    --ck-kart: {{ s.kart_boyut }}px;
    background: {{ s.arkaplan }};
    padding-top: {{ s.p_top_m }}px;
    padding-bottom: {{ s.p_bot_m }}px;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-ic {
    max-width: {{ s.max_w }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding-left: 16px;
    padding-right: 16px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* --- hap --- */
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-hap {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 7px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    height: 34px;
    min-width: 170px;
    padding: 0 14px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: {{ s.hap_zemin }};
    border: 1px solid {{ s.hap_kenar }};
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1;
    white-space: nowrap;
    color: {{ s.hap_renk }};
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-hap svg {
    width: 17px;
    height: 17px;
    flex: none;
    display: block;
  }

  /* --- baslik --- */
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-baslik {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: {{ s.baslik_m }}px;
    line-height: 1.15;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: {{ s.baslik_renk }};
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-vurgu {
    font-style: normal;
    color: var(--ck-vurgu);
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-alt {
    margin: 10px 0 0;
    max-width: 320px;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: {{ s.alt_renk }};
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-kanit {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 7px;
    margin: 14px 0 0;
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: {{ s.kanit_renk }};
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-yildizlar {
    flex: none;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1px;
    line-height: 0;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-yildizlar svg {
    width: 13px;
    height: 13px;
    display: block;
    fill: {{ s.yildiz_renk }};
  }

  /* ekran okuyucu metni */
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-gizli {
    position: absolute;
    width: 1px;
    height: 1px;
    margin: -1px;
    padding: 0;
    border: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    clip: rect(0 0 0 0);
    clip-path: inset(50%);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  /* --- SAHNE --- */
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-sahne {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: {{ s.sahne_genislik }}px;
    height: 320px;
    margin-top: {{ s.sahne_bosluk }}px;
    border-radius: {{ s.kose }}px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: linear-gradient(158deg, var(--ck-sahne1) 0%, var(--ck-sahne2) 100%);
    contain: paint;
  }

  /* sayac hapi */
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-sayac {
    position: absolute;
    top: 14px;
    left: 50%;
    z-index: 4;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    height: 36px;
    padding: 0 14px 0 6px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: #FFFFFF;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(20, 28, 36, .14), 0 1px 2px rgba(20, 28, 36, .08);
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    transform-origin: 50% 50%;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-sayac-yuvarlak {
    flex: none;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: {{ s.sayac_daire }};
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-sayac-yuvarlak svg {
    width: 13px;
    height: 13px;
    display: block;
    stroke: #FFFFFF;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-sayi {
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: #15181C;
    /* sayi degisirken genislik oynamasin */
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    font-feature-settings: "tnum" 1;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-sayac-etiket {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1;
    color: #6C757E;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-delta {
    position: absolute;
    left: 100%;
    top: 50%;
    margin-left: 8px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1;
    white-space: nowrap;
    color: {{ s.sayac_daire }};
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    pointer-events: none;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }

  /* kapsuller */
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-kapsuller {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    top: 60px;
    height: 124px;
    z-index: 2;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-isik {
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    top: 50%;
    width: 240px;
    height: 240px;
    margin: -120px 0 0 -120px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,255,255,.95) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,.45) 38%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 70%);
    opacity: 1;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  {%- comment -%}
    Yuvanin oranini GORSELIN kendi orani belirliyor: boylece
    object-fit: contain hic bos kenar birakmiyor, kose yuvarlatmasi
    gercekten gorunuyor ve kilit rozeti gorselin kosesinde kaliyor.
    Gorsel yoksa eski 86/106 orani.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-kapsul {
    position: relative;
    flex: none;
    width: auto;
    height: var(--ck-kapsul-y);
    /* cok yatay bir gorsel sahneyi dagitmasin */
    max-width: calc(var(--ck-kapsul-y) * 1.3);
    will-change: transform;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-kapsul--sol { aspect-ratio: {{ oran1 }}; }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-kapsul--sag { aspect-ratio: {{ oran2 }}; }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-kapsul img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: contain;
    border-radius: var(--ck-gorsel-kose);
    filter: drop-shadow(0 6px 14px rgba(24, 32, 40, .22));
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-bos {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    border: 1px dashed #A9B2BC;
    border-radius: 10px;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-kilit {
    position: absolute;
    right: -4px;
    bottom: 6px;
    z-index: 3;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 22px;
    height: 22px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: {{ s.sayac_daire }};
    box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(20, 28, 36, .2);
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-kilit svg {
    grid-area: 1 / 1;
    width: 12px;
    height: 12px;
    display: block;
    stroke: #FFFFFF;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-kilit-kapali { opacity: 0; }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-kilit-acik { opacity: 1; }

  /* 1. asamada kenarlardan gelen kucuk kartlar */
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-kart {
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    top: 50%;
    z-index: 4;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    width: var(--ck-kart);
    height: var(--ck-kart);
    margin: calc(var(--ck-kart) / -2) 0 0 calc(var(--ck-kart) / -2);
    border-radius: calc(var(--ck-kart) * .27);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .94);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .9);
    box-shadow: 0 5px 16px rgba(20, 28, 36, .26);
    opacity: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-kart svg {
    width: calc(var(--ck-kart) * .54);
    height: calc(var(--ck-kart) * .54);
    display: block;
    stroke: #39434E;
  }

  /* 3. asamada kapsullerden ayrilip cizelgeye giden foto karti */
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-ucus {
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    top: 120px;
    z-index: 5;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 26px;
    height: 26px;
    border-radius: 7px;
    background: #FFFFFF;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(20, 28, 36, .18);
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-ucus svg {
    width: 13px;
    height: 13px;
    display: block;
    stroke: #46515C;
  }

  /* --- zaman cizelgesi --- */
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-cizelge {
    position: absolute;
    left: 16px;
    right: 16px;
    bottom: 12px;
    height: 78px;
    z-index: 3;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-cizgi {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    top: 28px;
    height: 2px;
    border-radius: 2px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(62,94,74,.18) 0%, rgba(62,94,74,.42) 50%, rgba(62,94,74,.18) 100%);
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-tirnak {
    position: absolute;
    top: 23px;
    width: 1px;
    height: 12px;
    background: #A8B1BA;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-yil {
    position: absolute;
    top: 58px;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: .02em;
    white-space: nowrap;
    color: #79828C;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-isaret {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-tarih {
    height: 14px;
    font-size: 9px;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 14px;
    white-space: nowrap;
    color: #5D666F;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-nokta {
    width: 11px;
    height: 11px;
    margin-top: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: {{ s.sayac_daire }};
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(255, 255, 255, .9);
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-hapf {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 3px;
    margin-top: 9px;
    padding: 2px 6px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: #FFFFFF;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(20, 28, 36, .12);
    font-size: 9px;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.2;
    white-space: nowrap;
    color: #30373E;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-hapf svg {
    width: 9px;
    height: 9px;
    flex: none;
    display: block;
    stroke: #6C757E;
  }
  {%- comment -%}
    Uclardaki isaretlerde yalnizca YAZI kayiyor; nokta takvimdeki
    gercek yerinde kaliyor.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-isaret[data-kenar="sol"] .tt-ck-tarih,
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-isaret[data-kenar="sol"] .tt-ck-hapf {
    transform: translateX(calc(50% - 7px));
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-isaret[data-kenar="sag"] .tt-ck-tarih,
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-isaret[data-kenar="sag"] .tt-ck-hapf {
    transform: translateX(calc(-50% + 7px));
  }

  /* --- adim satiri --- */
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-adimlar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 4px;
    margin: 16px 0 0;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-adim {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 5px 7px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    border: 0;
    background: transparent;
    /* Dort kelime 360px'te de tek satirda kalmali -- dar ekranda
       kucultulup 12px'te duruyor. */
    font-size: clamp(10px, 2.7vw, 12px);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.2;
    white-space: nowrap;
    color: {{ s.adim_renk }};
    transition: background-color 220ms ease, color 220ms ease;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-adim[data-aktif] {
    background: var(--ck-vurgu);
    color: {{ s.adim_aktif_renk }};
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-ayrac {
    flex: none;
    width: 3px;
    height: 3px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: {{ s.adim_renk }};
    opacity: .6;
  }

  /* ======================================================
     ANIMASYONLU HAL -- yalnizca JS koke data-ck-on basinca
     ====================================================== */
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} [data-ck-on] .tt-ck-isaret { opacity: 0; }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} [data-ck-on] .tt-ck-isaret[data-gor] { opacity: 1; }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} [data-ck-on] .tt-ck-isaret[data-gor] .tt-ck-nokta {
    animation: tt-ck-sic-{{ sid }} 520ms cubic-bezier(.2, 1.25, .35, 1) both;
  }
  @keyframes tt-ck-sic-{{ sid }} {
    0%   { transform: scale(0); }
    58%  { transform: scale(1.32); }
    100% { transform: scale(1); }
  }

  /* kapsuller: ayrik <-> bitisik */
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} [data-ck-on] .tt-ck-kapsul {
    transition: transform 650ms cubic-bezier(.22, .8, .3, 1);
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} [data-ck-on][data-ck-faz="yukle"] .tt-ck-kapsul--sol,
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} [data-ck-on][data-ck-faz="tekrar"] .tt-ck-kapsul--sol {
    transform: translateX(calc(-1 * var(--ck-ayrik)));
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} [data-ck-on][data-ck-faz="yukle"] .tt-ck-kapsul--sag,
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} [data-ck-on][data-ck-faz="tekrar"] .tt-ck-kapsul--sag {
    transform: translateX(var(--ck-ayrik));
  }

  /* isik: yalnizca bulusma aninda */
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} [data-ck-on] .tt-ck-isik {
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 420ms ease;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} [data-ck-on][data-ck-faz="bulus"] .tt-ck-isik,
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} [data-ck-on][data-ck-faz="birik"] .tt-ck-isik {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  /* kilit rozeti: ayrikken beyaz + kapali, bitisikken koyu yesil + acik */
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} [data-ck-on] .tt-ck-kilit {
    transition: background-color 300ms ease;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} [data-ck-on] .tt-ck-kilit svg {
    transition: opacity 220ms ease, stroke 300ms ease;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} [data-ck-on][data-ck-faz="yukle"] .tt-ck-kilit,
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} [data-ck-on][data-ck-faz="tekrar"] .tt-ck-kilit {
    background: #FFFFFF;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} [data-ck-on][data-ck-faz="yukle"] .tt-ck-kilit svg,
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} [data-ck-on][data-ck-faz="tekrar"] .tt-ck-kilit svg {
    stroke: #2B3138;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} [data-ck-on][data-ck-faz="yukle"] .tt-ck-kilit-acik,
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} [data-ck-on][data-ck-faz="tekrar"] .tt-ck-kilit-acik { opacity: 0; }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} [data-ck-on][data-ck-faz="yukle"] .tt-ck-kilit-kapali,
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} [data-ck-on][data-ck-faz="tekrar"] .tt-ck-kilit-kapali { opacity: 1; }

  /* 1. asama: kenarlardan gelip kapsulde kuculen kartlar */
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} [data-ck-on][data-ck-faz="yukle"] .tt-ck-kapsul--sol .tt-ck-kart {
    animation: tt-ck-gel-sol-{{ sid }} 760ms cubic-bezier(.3, .7, .2, 1) var(--g, 0ms) both;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} [data-ck-on][data-ck-faz="yukle"] .tt-ck-kapsul--sag .tt-ck-kart {
    animation: tt-ck-gel-sag-{{ sid }} 760ms cubic-bezier(.3, .7, .2, 1) var(--g, 0ms) both;
  }
  @keyframes tt-ck-gel-sol-{{ sid }} {
    0%   { transform: translate(-160px, var(--dy, 0px)) scale(1); opacity: 0; }
    14%  { opacity: 1; }
    86%  { opacity: 1; }
    100% { transform: translate(0, 0) scale(.26); opacity: 0; }
  }
  @keyframes tt-ck-gel-sag-{{ sid }} {
    0%   { transform: translate(160px, var(--dy, 0px)) scale(1); opacity: 0; }
    14%  { opacity: 1; }
    86%  { opacity: 1; }
    100% { transform: translate(0, 0) scale(.26); opacity: 0; }
  }

  /* 3. asama: kapsullerden cizelgeye giden foto karti */
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} [data-ck-on] .tt-ck-ucus[data-gor] {
    animation: tt-ck-ucus-{{ sid }} 820ms cubic-bezier(.35, .1, .25, 1) both;
  }
  @keyframes tt-ck-ucus-{{ sid }} {
    0%   { transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(.5); opacity: 0; }
    16%  { transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1); opacity: 1; }
    100% {
      transform: translate(calc(-50% + var(--hx, 0px)), calc(-50% + var(--hy, 0px))) scale(.4);
      opacity: 0;
    }
  }

  /* sayac hapinin zipi + "+1.430" */
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} [data-ck-on] .tt-ck-sayac[data-pop] {
    animation: tt-ck-pop-{{ sid }} 440ms cubic-bezier(.3, 1.1, .4, 1) both;
  }
  @keyframes tt-ck-pop-{{ sid }} {
    0%   { transform: translateX(-50%) scale(1); }
    42%  { transform: translateX(-50%) scale(1.09); }
    100% { transform: translateX(-50%) scale(1); }
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} [data-ck-on] .tt-ck-delta[data-gor] {
    animation: tt-ck-delta-{{ sid }} 1100ms ease-out both;
  }
  @keyframes tt-ck-delta-{{ sid }} {
    0%   { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-50%); }
    18%  { opacity: 1; }
    70%  { opacity: 1; }
    100% { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(calc(-50% - 16px)); }
  }

  /* --- masaustu --- */
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-root {
      padding-top: {{ s.p_top_d }}px;
      padding-bottom: {{ s.p_bot_d }}px;
    }
    #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-baslik { font-size: {{ s.baslik_t }}px; }
    #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-alt { max-width: 520px; font-size: 15px; }
  }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-root {
      --ck-kapsul-g: 118px;
      --ck-kapsul-y: 146px;
      --ck-ayrik: 48px;
      --ck-kart: {{ s.kart_boyut | times: 1.25 | round }}px;
    }
    #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-baslik { font-size: {{ s.baslik_d }}px; }
    #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-sahne { height: 400px; }
    #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-kapsuller { top: 76px; height: 168px; }
    #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-ucus { top: 160px; }
    #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-cizelge { left: 40px; right: 40px; bottom: 20px; height: 86px; }
    #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-cizgi { top: 32px; }
    #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-tirnak { top: 27px; }
    #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-yil { top: 64px; font-size: 11px; }
    #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-tarih { font-size: 10px; height: 16px; line-height: 16px; }
    #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-nokta { margin-top: 10px; }
    #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-hapf { font-size: 10px; }
    #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-sayac { top: 18px; }
    #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-adimlar { gap: 8px; }
    #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-adim { font-size: 13px; padding: 5px 11px; }
  }

  {%- comment -%}
    Azaltilmis harekette JS zaten hic baslamiyor (data-ck-on basilmaz),
    yani isaretlemenin statik hali ekranda kalir. Asagidakiler emniyet
    kemeri: bir sekilde baslasa bile hicbir sey oynamaz.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .tt-ck-root * {
      animation: none !important;
      transition: none !important;
    }
    #shopify-section-{{ sid }} [data-ck-on] .tt-ck-isaret { opacity: 1 !important; }
    #shopify-section-{{ sid }} [data-ck-on] .tt-ck-kapsul { transform: none !important; }
    #shopify-section-{{ sid }} [data-ck-on] .tt-ck-isik { opacity: 1 !important; }
  }
</style>

<div class="tt-ck-root">
  <div class="tt-ck-ic" data-ck-kok data-ck-sure="{{ s.sayac_sure | default: 800 }}">
    {%- if s.hap_metni != blank -%}
      <span class="tt-ck-hap">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
          <rect x="4.8" y="10.4" width="14.4" height="9.4" rx="2"/>
          <path d="M8.2 10.4V7.6a3.8 3.8 0 0 1 7.3-1.4"/>
          <path d="M12 14.2v2"/>
        </svg>
        {{ s.hap_metni | escape }}
      </span>
    {%- endif -%}

    <h2 class="tt-ck-baslik">
      {{- s.baslik_1 | escape -}}
      <br>
      {%- if s.baslik_vurgu != blank -%}
        <em class="tt-ck-vurgu">{{ s.baslik_vurgu | escape }}</em>
        {{ ' ' }}
      {%- endif -%}
      {{- s.baslik_2 | escape -}}
    </h2>

    {%- if s.alt_metin != blank -%}
      <p class="tt-ck-alt">{{ s.alt_metin | escape }}</p>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if s.kanit_ac and s.kanit_metin != blank -%}
      <div class="tt-ck-kanit">
        <span class="tt-ck-yildizlar" role="img" aria-label="5 üzerinden 5 yıldız">
          {%- for i in (1..5) -%}
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
              <path d="M12 2.4l2.9 5.88 6.49.94-4.7 4.58 1.11 6.46L12 17.2l-5.8 3.06 1.11-6.46-4.7-4.58 6.49-.94z"/>
            </svg>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </span>
        <span>{{ s.kanit_metin | escape }}</span>
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- comment -%}
      Sahne tamamen dekoratif: ekran okuyucu tek bir ozet cumle duyar.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <span class="tt-ck-gizli">İki kapsüle de anı yüklenir, kapsüller yan yana gelince açılır, anılar zaman çizgisinde birikir, uzaklaşınca tekrar kilitlenir.</span>

    <div class="tt-ck-sahne" data-ck-sahne aria-hidden="true">
      {%- comment -%} ----- sayac ----- {%- endcomment -%}
      <span class="tt-ck-sayac" data-ck-hap>
        <span class="tt-ck-sayac-yuvarlak">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
            <path d="M3.4 8.4a1.8 1.8 0 0 1 1.8-1.8h2l1.2-2h7.2l1.2 2h2a1.8 1.8 0 0 1 1.8 1.8v8.4a1.8 1.8 0 0 1-1.8 1.8H5.2a1.8 1.8 0 0 1-1.8-1.8z"/>
            <circle cx="12" cy="12.4" r="3.3"/>
          </svg>
        </span>
        <span class="tt-ck-sayi" data-ck-sayac>{{ son_bicim }}</span>
        <span class="tt-ck-sayac-etiket">{{ s.sayac_etiket | escape }}</span>
        <span class="tt-ck-delta" data-ck-delta></span>
      </span>

      {%- comment -%} ----- kapsuller ----- {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="tt-ck-kapsuller">
        <span class="tt-ck-isik" data-ck-isik></span>

        {%- assign yon_ler = 'sol,sag' | split: ',' -%}
        {%- for yon in yon_ler -%}
          {%- if forloop.first -%}
            {%- assign gorsel = s.gorsel_1 -%}
          {%- else -%}
            {%- assign gorsel = s.gorsel_2 -%}
          {%- endif -%}
          <div class="tt-ck-kapsul tt-ck-kapsul--{{ yon }}">
            {%- if gorsel != blank -%}
              {{ gorsel | image_url: width: 320 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: '', widths: '160,240,320' }}
            {%- elsif request.design_mode -%}
              {%- comment -%}
                Kesikli kutu YALNIZCA tema editorunde: canli sayfada
                gorsel yoksa yuva bos kalir, sahne calismaya devam eder.
              {%- endcomment -%}
              <span class="tt-ck-bos"></span>
            {%- endif -%}

            {%- comment -%}
              Yukleme kartlari kapsulun ICINDE: kapsul ayrilip
              birlesirken onlarla birlikte hareket ediyorlar.
            {%- endcomment -%}
            {%- if forloop.first -%}
              {%- assign ikonlar = 'foto,mikrofon' | split: ',' -%}
              {%- assign gecikmeler = '0,220' | split: ',' -%}
              {%- assign dikeyler = '-26,18' | split: ',' -%}
            {%- else -%}
              {%- assign ikonlar = 'video,foto' | split: ',' -%}
              {%- assign gecikmeler = '110,330' | split: ',' -%}
              {%- assign dikeyler = '-14,30' | split: ',' -%}
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- for ikon in ikonlar -%}
              <i class="tt-ck-kart" style="--g: {{ gecikmeler[forloop.index0] }}ms; --dy: {{ dikeyler[forloop.index0] }}px;">
                {%- case ikon -%}
                  {%- when 'mikrofon' -%}
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                      <rect x="9" y="2.8" width="6" height="11" rx="3"/>
                      <path d="M5.6 11.4a6.4 6.4 0 0 0 12.8 0"/>
                      <path d="M12 17.8v3.4"/>
                    </svg>
                  {%- when 'video' -%}
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                      <rect x="2.8" y="6.2" width="13" height="11.6" rx="2"/>
                      <path d="M15.8 10.6l5.4-3v8.8l-5.4-3z"/>
                    </svg>
                  {%- else -%}
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                      <path d="M3.4 8.4a1.8 1.8 0 0 1 1.8-1.8h2l1.2-2h7.2l1.2 2h2a1.8 1.8 0 0 1 1.8 1.8v8.4a1.8 1.8 0 0 1-1.8 1.8H5.2a1.8 1.8 0 0 1-1.8-1.8z"/>
                      <circle cx="12" cy="12.4" r="3.3"/>
                    </svg>
                {%- endcase -%}
              </i>
            {%- endfor -%}

            <span class="tt-ck-kilit">
              <svg class="tt-ck-kilit-acik" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                <rect x="4.8" y="10.4" width="14.4" height="9.4" rx="2"/>
                <path d="M8.2 10.4V7.6a3.8 3.8 0 0 1 7.3-1.4"/>
              </svg>
              <svg class="tt-ck-kilit-kapali" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                <rect x="4.8" y="10.4" width="14.4" height="9.4" rx="2"/>
                <path d="M8.2 10.4V7.6a3.8 3.8 0 0 1 7.6 0v2.8"/>
              </svg>
            </span>
          </div>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </div>

      {%- comment -%} ----- cizelgeye ucan foto karti ----- {%- endcomment -%}
      <i class="tt-ck-ucus" data-ck-ucus>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
          <path d="M3.4 8.4a1.8 1.8 0 0 1 1.8-1.8h2l1.2-2h7.2l1.2 2h2a1.8 1.8 0 0 1 1.8 1.8v8.4a1.8 1.8 0 0 1-1.8 1.8H5.2a1.8 1.8 0 0 1-1.8-1.8z"/>
          <circle cx="12" cy="12.4" r="3.3"/>
        </svg>
      </i>

      {%- comment -%} ----- zaman cizelgesi ----- {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="tt-ck-cizelge">
        <span class="tt-ck-cizgi"></span>

        {%- for y in (yb..ys) -%}
          {%- assign bas_ay = forloop.index0 | times: 12 -%}
          {%- assign tp = bas_ay | times: 1.0 | divided_by: bolen | times: 100 | round: 3 -%}
          <span class="tt-ck-tirnak" style="left: {{ tp }}%;"></span>
          {%- assign orta_ay = bas_ay | plus: 5.5 -%}
          {%- assign yp = orta_ay | times: 1.0 | divided_by: bolen | times: 100 | round: 3 -%}
          {%- if yp > 100 -%}{%- assign yp = 100 -%}{%- endif -%}
          <span class="tt-ck-yil" style="left: {{ yp }}%;">{{ y }}</span>
        {%- endfor -%}

        {%- for block in bloklar -%}
          {%- liquid
            assign by = block.settings.yil | plus: 0
            if by < yb
              assign by = yb
            endif
            if by > ys
              assign by = ys
            endif
            assign ba = block.settings.ay | plus: 0
            if ba < 1
              assign ba = 1
            endif
            if ba > 12
              assign ba = 12
            endif
            assign idx = by | minus: yb | times: 12 | plus: ba | minus: 1
            assign np = idx | times: 1.0 | divided_by: bolen | times: 100 | round: 3
            assign nsayi = block.settings.foto | plus: 0
            assign kenar = ''
            if np < 12
              assign kenar = 'sol'
            endif
            if np > 88
              assign kenar = 'sag'
            endif
          -%}
          {%- capture nbicim -%}
            {%- assign ham = nsayi | append: '' -%}
            {%- assign uz = ham.size -%}
            {%- assign bic = '' -%}
            {%- for i in (1..uz) -%}
              {%- assign yer = uz | minus: i -%}
              {%- assign ch = ham | slice: yer, 1 -%}
              {%- assign bic = ch | append: bic -%}
              {%- assign m = i | modulo: 3 -%}
              {%- if m == 0 and yer > 0 -%}
                {%- assign bic = '.' | append: bic -%}
              {%- endif -%}
            {%- endfor -%}
            {{- bic -}}
          {%- endcapture -%}
          <span
            class="tt-ck-isaret"
            data-ck-isaret
            data-ck-sayi="{{ nsayi }}"
            {% if kenar != blank %}data-kenar="{{ kenar }}"{% endif %}
            style="left: {{ np }}%;"
            {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
          >
            <span class="tt-ck-tarih">{{ block.settings.etiket | escape }}</span>
            <span class="tt-ck-nokta" data-ck-nokta></span>
            <span class="tt-ck-hapf">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                <path d="M3.4 8.4a1.8 1.8 0 0 1 1.8-1.8h2l1.2-2h7.2l1.2 2h2a1.8 1.8 0 0 1 1.8 1.8v8.4a1.8 1.8 0 0 1-1.8 1.8H5.2a1.8 1.8 0 0 1-1.8-1.8z"/>
                <circle cx="12" cy="12.4" r="3.3"/>
              </svg>
              {{ nbicim | strip }}
            </span>
          </span>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </div>
    </div>

    {%- comment -%} ----- adimlar ----- {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- assign adim_ler = '1,2,3,4' | split: ',' -%}
    <div class="tt-ck-adimlar">
      {%- for a in adim_ler -%}
        {%- case a -%}
          {%- when '1' -%}{%- assign adim_metin = s.adim_1 -%}
          {%- when '2' -%}{%- assign adim_metin = s.adim_2 -%}
          {%- when '3' -%}{%- assign adim_metin = s.adim_3 -%}
          {%- else -%}{%- assign adim_metin = s.adim_4 -%}
        {%- endcase -%}
        {%- unless forloop.first -%}<i class="tt-ck-ayrac"></i>{%- endunless -%}
        <span class="tt-ck-adim" data-ck-adim="{{ forloop.index0 }}">{{ adim_metin | escape }}</span>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<script src="{{ 'tt-ck-sahne.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "TT Couple Kapsül",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "tt-couple-kapsul-section",
  "enabled_on": { "templates": ["collection"] },
  "settings": [
    { "type": "header", "content": "Üst metinler" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "hap_metni", "label": "Hap metni", "default": "Buluşunca açılır" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "baslik_1", "label": "Başlık 1. satır", "default": "Ayrıyken biriktirin," },
    { "type": "text", "id": "baslik_vurgu", "label": "Vurgulu kelime", "default": "buluşunca" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "baslik_2", "label": "Satır devamı", "default": "açın." },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "alt_metin", "label": "Alt metin",
      "default": "İkiniz de anı yükleyin. Kapsüller yan yana gelince açılır, uzaklaşınca kilitlenir." },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "kanit_ac", "label": "Yıldız satırı", "default": true },
    { "type": "text", "id": "kanit_metin", "label": "Yıldız satırı metni", "default": "100.000'den fazla kişi kullanıyor" },

    { "type": "header", "content": "Sahne" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "gorsel_1", "label": "Ürün görseli 1",
      "info": "Arka planı saydam PNG önerilir. Boşsa yuva canlı sayfada boş kalır." },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "gorsel_2", "label": "Ürün görseli 2" },
    { "type": "range", "id": "gorsel_kose", "label": "Ürün görseli köşe yarıçapı", "unit": "px",
      "min": 0, "max": 32, "step": 1, "default": 14 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "kart_boyut", "label": "Uçan anı kartı boyutu", "unit": "px",
      "min": 18, "max": 48, "step": 1, "default": 32,
      "info": "Kapsüllerin içine giren küçük kartlar. Masaüstünde 1,25 kat büyür." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "sayac_etiket", "label": "Sayaç etiketi", "default": "fotoğraf" },
    { "type": "range", "id": "sayac_sure", "label": "Sayaç sayma süresi", "unit": "ms",
      "min": 300, "max": 1600, "step": 50, "default": 800 },
    { "type": "number", "id": "yil_bas", "label": "Zaman çizgisi başlangıç yılı", "default": 2025 },
    { "type": "number", "id": "yil_son", "label": "Zaman çizgisi bitiş yılı", "default": 2027 },

    { "type": "header", "content": "Adımlar" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "adim_1", "label": "1. adım", "default": "Yükleyin" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "adim_2", "label": "2. adım", "default": "Buluşun" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "adim_3", "label": "3. adım", "default": "Biriktirin" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "adim_4", "label": "4. adım", "default": "Tekrarlayın" },

    { "type": "header", "content": "Renkler" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "arkaplan", "label": "Bölüm arka planı", "default": "#181B1E" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "hap_zemin", "label": "Hap dolgusu", "default": "#1C232B" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "hap_kenar", "label": "Hap çerçevesi", "default": "#2A323C" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "hap_renk", "label": "Hap yazısı", "default": "#E6E8EB" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "baslik_renk", "label": "Başlık", "default": "#FFFFFF" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "vurgu_renk", "label": "Vurgulu kelime ve aktif adım", "default": "#9FD4BD" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "alt_renk", "label": "Alt metin", "default": "#B8BEC6" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "yildiz_renk", "label": "Yıldızlar", "default": "#E0A95A" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "kanit_renk", "label": "Yıldız satırı yazısı", "default": "#8B939D" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "sahne_renk_1", "label": "Sahne degrade üst", "default": "#EDEFF2" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "sahne_renk_2", "label": "Sahne degrade alt", "default": "#D9DDE3" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "sayac_daire", "label": "Sayaç dairesi, nokta ve kilit", "default": "#3E5E4A" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "adim_renk", "label": "Pasif adım", "default": "#7D858E" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "adim_aktif_renk", "label": "Aktif adım yazısı", "default": "#16231C" },

    { "type": "header", "content": "Ölçüler" },
    { "type": "range", "id": "baslik_m", "label": "Başlık (mobil)", "unit": "px", "min": 20, "max": 40, "step": 1, "default": 28 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "baslik_t", "label": "Başlık (tablet)", "unit": "px", "min": 24, "max": 52, "step": 1, "default": 36 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "baslik_d", "label": "Başlık (masaüstü)", "unit": "px", "min": 28, "max": 64, "step": 1, "default": 44 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "max_w", "label": "İçerik genişliği", "unit": "px", "min": 600, "max": 1600, "step": 20, "default": 1200 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "sahne_genislik", "label": "Sahne genişliği", "unit": "px", "min": 600, "max": 1600, "step": 20, "default": 1100 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "sahne_bosluk", "label": "Sahne üst boşluğu", "unit": "px", "min": 0, "max": 80, "step": 2, "default": 32 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "kose", "label": "Sahne köşe yarıçapı", "unit": "px", "min": 0, "max": 40, "step": 1, "default": 16 },
